Warning [jet.PathContainmentStringPrefix]: A typed normalized Path is checked with a string prefix
  --> Tests/UILint/path_containment_string_prefix.jet:22:8
    |
 22 |     if candidate != base && !candidate.starts_with("{base}/") -> print("allowed")
    |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Path.is_within()` owns separator-aware lexical containment; converting both paths to strings repeats that policy
 Fix: Replace the string comparison with `Path.is_within()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0517
